#       Structs, enums, vtables, class information and cast helpers generated from
#       Libraries/LibMedia/PlaybackManager.h (Ladybird 47c82b38d0) by the skeleton generator
#       (DESIGN.md §4.4). Regenerate rather than edit, except to fill a field the generator
#       could not map.
#
#       Filled by hand for the LibMedia seam (playback_manager.lucb): the manager keeps what
#       a manager without demuxers has. Its track lists and track data (each with a data
#       provider and a sink) are always empty, so the data providers, the audio mixing sink
#       and the displaying video sinks are left out; its state handler is the Starting state
#       (Media/PlaybackStates), the one a manager without tracks stays in.
#
#==============================================================================================

